{"overview":"مشت زنی درجه چندم و گمنام به نام «راک بالبوا» (استالون) از راه شرکت در مسابقه های بوکس شرطی و غیرقانونی و جمع آوری طلب های یک نزول خوار زندگی فقیرانه ای را می گذراند. تا این که قهرمان بوکس سنگین وزن جهان، «آپولو» (ودرز)، برای تبلیغ و رسیدن به محبوبیت بیش تر، تصمیم می گیرد تا مسابقه ای نمایشی با یک مشت زن گم نام برگزار کند. به این منظور «راکی» انتخاب می شود…","tagline":"","overview_en":"Rocky Balboa is a Philadelphia club fighter who seems to be going nowhere. But when a stroke of fate puts him in the ring with a world heavyweight champion, Rocky knows that it's his one shot at the big time — a once-in-a-lifetime opportunity to go the distance and come out a winner!","tagline_en":"His whole life was a million-to-one shot.","runtime":119,"status":"Released","seasons":[],"episodes":null,"crew":["John G. Avildsen"],"crew_en":[],"countries":["US"],"cast":[{"name":"سیلوستر استالونه","role":"Robert 'Rocky' Balboa","photo":"/gn3pDWthJqR0VDYGViGD3048og7.jpg","en":"Sylvester Stallone"},{"name":"تالیا شایر","role":"Adrianna 'Adrian' Pennino","photo":"/oktJmlLeyYKBCWPNjHskDwAfjct.jpg","en":"Talia Shire"},{"name":"Burt Young","role":"Paulie","photo":"/6QWnsSbjYog0D6hkPhg7Frty54D.jpg"},{"name":"کارل ویترز","role":"Apollo","photo":"/oUwtC5hEbcIZv53WPerZ9HhlSJR.jpg","en":"Carl Weathers"},{"name":"Burgess Meredith","role":"Mickey","photo":"/2ozNyIbHChcqIBANwvCDpUZGA9b.jpg"},{"name":"Thayer David","role":"Jergens","photo":"/gAkmthly4dMu2Az8SNVWNSeRsYy.jpg"},{"name":"Joe Spinell","role":"Gazzo","photo":"/rdDEi8SJSx9OwVJQaHNa3VfZBRM.jpg"},{"name":"Jimmy Gambina","role":"Mike","photo":"/7z9cLBNBk67xstIS4dp2pMAgVyr.jpg"},{"name":"Bill Baldwin","role":"Fight Announcer","photo":"/lxPg2ucKAdQJ2L3jT0Ob3E6kvS0.jpg"},{"name":"Al Silvani","role":"Cut Man","photo":"/j6M9EdM5seejyRK769haG7iluW4.jpg"},{"name":"George Memmoli","role":"Ice Rink Attendant","photo":"/kwhNDLl84nM22xcVexVnsp8H7RB.jpg"},{"name":"Jodi Letizia","role":"Marie","photo":"/qhRD3wfrAZ4Oo1na3jkSEDCwPP4.jpg"}],"trail